{"code":"var s=Editor.SceneEditorSession.All.First(x=>x.Scene.Name==\"veridant\");return s.Scene.GetAllComponents<ModelRenderer>().Where(x=>x.Model!=null&&(x.Model.ResourcePath.Contains(\"sofa_v2\")||x.Model.ResourcePath.Contains(\"lounge_coffee_table_v1\"))).Select(x=>new{x.GameObject.Name,x.Model.ResourcePath,Scale=x.GameObject.WorldScale.ToString(),Bounds=x.Model.Bounds.ToString()}).ToArray();"}
